  id: stone_warden
  displayName: Stone Warden
  description: Tier 1 Warden, guarding a small Lowlands ruin. Slow but devastating
    melee fight.
  tier: 1
  family: 1
  behaviors:
  - Slow movement, telegraphed attacks.
  - "Becomes faster as cracks widen \u2014 at 50% HP, charges briefly."
  - Cannot be staggered by light attacks.
  - 'Vulnerable spot: the glowing core in his chest, exposed after a charge.'
  abilities:
  - "Maul Slam \u2014 straight-line AOE"
  - "Quake Stomp \u2014 circular AOE, knocks player back"
  - "Boulder Throw \u2014 ranged option, dodgeable"
  - "Charge Rush \u2014 only at lower HP, exposes core after"
  dropItemIds:
  - Smith's Hammer (Forge recipe unlock)
  - Stone Cube x12, Iron Ingot x4
  - Warden's Core (masterwork tool material)
  - Spirit Anchor
  boss_section: Warden Family
  isBoss: 1
  isFinale: 0
  baseHealth: 30
  baseSpeed: 4
